  "notes": "{滞納|たいのう} is a formal term for failing to pay bills, taxes, or other obligations on time.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {税金|ぜいきん}を{滞納|たいのう}する (fail to pay taxes)\n- {家賃|やちん}の{滞納|たいのう} (rent arrears)\n- {滞納|たいのう}{者|しゃ} (delinquent payer)\n- {滞納|たいのう}{金|きん} (overdue payment)\n- {滞納|たいのう}{処分|しょぶん} (action for non-payment)\n\nUSAGE NOTE: A formal/legal term. In casual conversation, people might say {払|はら}っていない (haven't paid) instead.",
